syntax:
Loop Unrolling:
```c
for (i = 0; i < n; i += k) {
  // Replicate loop body k times
  body(data[i]);
  body(data[i+1]);
  ...
  body(data[i+k-1]);
}
```
Reassociation:
Changing the order of operations while maintaining the mathematical equivalence.  This often exploits the associative property of addition and multiplication.
